# JetNote Kotlin / Compose

## File placement

- Screen composables and `*ViewModel.kt` live in `com.hmyh.jetnote.screen`.
- Shared inputs/buttons: `components/` (`NoteInputText`, `NoteButton`).
- Room entities: `model/` (`Note` with `@Entity`).
- DB, DAO, converters, seed data: `data/`.

## Compose

- Wrap app UI in `JetNoteTheme`; use Material 3 (`MaterialTheme`, `TopAppBar`, `LazyColumn`).
- Pass events up: `onAddNote`, `onRemoveNote`, `onNoteClick` (see `NoteScreen`).
- Detail screen: `NoteDetailScreen` with `onBackClick`.
- Use `@Preview` with `NoteDataSource().loadNotes()` for screen previews.

## ViewModel

- Extend `ViewModel`; currently holds `mutableStateListOf<Note>` seeded from `NoteDataSource`.
- **Next step**: `@HiltViewModel` + inject `NoteDatabaseDao`, collect `Flow<List<Note>>` instead of in-memory list.
- Do not instantiate `NoteDataSource()` in production path once DAO is wired.

## Models & Room

```kotlin
// model/Note.kt — Room entity
@Entity(tableName = "notes_tbl")
data class Note(
    @PrimaryKey val id: UUID = UUID.randomUUID(),
    val title: String,
    val description: String,
    val entryDate: Date = Date.from(Instant.now())
)

// data/Converters.kt — required for Date and UUID columns
@TypeConverter fun dateToTimestamp(date: Date?): Long?
@TypeConverter fun fromTimestamp(value: Long?): Date?
@TypeConverter fun uuidToString(uuid: UUID?): String?
@TypeConverter fun fromUuid(value: String?): UUID?
```

- Register converters: `@TypeConverters(Converters::class)` on `NoteDatabase`.
- DAO query IDs must match entity type (`UUID`, not `Int`).
